career-ops (https://github.com/career-ops-hq/career-ops)
The interview preparation of the documents module (api/app/documents/interview_prep.py and the
prompts api/app/documents/prompts/interview_*.md) follows the shape of its interview modes
(interview-prep, practice, debrief and the story bank), without their web research.

The keyword coverage of a written CV (api/app/documents/coverage.py) is adapted from its
keyword-match.mjs; the starter list of banned phrases (api/app/documents/settings.py) is taken
from its cv-voice.mjs; keeping a chat correction as a writing rule
(api/app/documents/writing_rules.py) follows its modes/retro.md.

Reading an offer (api/app/documents/offer_notes.py and the prompts
api/app/documents/prompts/offer_notes*.md) follows the posture of its offer-prep mode: a clause
walk in plain words, the deltas against the posting's pay and questions for a lawyer, never a
verdict or a score, without its web research.

Your search in numbers (api/app/opportunities/insights.py, web/src/features/jobs/helpers/insights.ts)
takes its floors, its silent window and its two dated benchmarks from calibrate.mjs,
funnel-velocity.mjs, analyze-patterns.mjs, close-stale.mjs and templates/benchmarks.yml; the reasons
of a Pass (api/app/opportunities/passes.py, web/src/features/opportunities/helpers/deck/pass-reasons.ts)
from templates/discard-reasons.yml.

What a posting says before the click (api/app/jobs/signals.py and api/app/jobs/notices.py)
adapts its rules: the eligibility and Block G signals of modes/oferta.md, the closing date
markers and the unambiguous date rule of closing-soon.mjs, the cross-listing check of
docs/FAQ.md section 5 (a 64-bit SimHash, different companies, at most 5 of 64 bits apart) and
the company history of company-history.mjs.

Assess this posting (api/app/jobs/assess.py and api/app/jobs/role_clarity.py) is adapted from
its evaluation mode (modes/oferta.md: the requirement table, the culture screen, the text
signals, the verdict) and from role-clarity.mjs.

The follow up cadence and the rules of the follow up draft of the apply module
(api/app/apply/followups.py and api/app/apply/prompts/followup.md) are adapted from its
followup-cadence.mjs and modes/followup.md.

The closure sentences, their tiers and guards of the jobs module's posting check
(api/app/jobs/liveness.py) are adapted from its liveness-core.mjs.

